 "description": "Meyer1991_CalciumSpike_ICC\nBioModels BIOMD0000000224 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000224_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 300 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000224_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating), sampling 0.3.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.54e-06 of species peak (worst: CaS)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] 'g' goes below zero in the SBML: integrated as g_o = value + 0.2, output as g = OUTC[g_o;-0.2*source]\n  [info] JChannel term 2/4: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - CaI: zero order, signed\n  [info] JChannel term 4/4: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - CaI: zero order, signed\n  [info] JPump: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] kPLC term 2/2: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - IP3: zero order, signed",
